Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 01:06:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Conduit & Duct Bank as its own top-level project
 section
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Splits ductery out of the Fiber module into an independent section
(sidebar entry + /conduit route), per Marcelo's decision to stop
folding conduit into other modules' maps. First-cut read-only view:
duct bank runs (conduit_runs) and structures (conduit_structures),
both already mirrored automatically off fiber routes/nodes, now get
their own list with condition/work-scope pills and summary metrics.

- getConduitData() in actions-fiber.ts: joins conduit_structures with
  fiber_nodes and conduit_runs with fiber_routes for display context.
- disciplines.ts: 'conduit' entry flips ready:false -> true and its
  href moves off the shared 'fiber' route to its own 'conduit' route.
- New /conduit route (page.tsx + ConduitPageClient.tsx) — table view
  only for this pass; the dedicated cross-section design view and
  conduit fill % calculation are a separate follow-up.

The combined general map is left untouched for now, per Marcelo's
request, since a client is actively viewing it.
